        <detaileddescription>
<para>Parse the entire string and return a value. The matching of the parser against the input is performed by calling <ref refid="classSawyer_1_1CommandLine_1_1ValueParser_1aa61c5c7afd2527f9bf64bdc478b1d854" kindref="member">match</ref>, which may throw an exception if the input is matched but cannot be converted to a value (e.g., integer overflow). If the parser did not match the entire string, then an <computeroutput>std::runtime_error</computeroutput> is thrown. </para>        </detaileddescription>
